1
00:00:00,413 --> 00:00:03,503
(Raj:)-Why didn't you say anything?
-I was waiting for the right time.

2
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:04,917
(Howard:)This is the right time.

3
00:00:06,503 --> 00:00:07,923
Hey, who's ready for "Halo"?

4
00:00:08,088 --> 00:00:10,258
(Raj:)Oh, this is like a nightmare. Get lost.

5
00:00:11,758 --> 00:00:13,888
(Howard:)The numbers
are shaky enough as it is.

6
00:00:14,094 --> 00:00:15,424
(Leonard:)I don't understand.

7
00:00:16,346 --> 00:00:18,226
(Elizabeth:)Oh, good. Leonard's here.

8
00:00:18,431 --> 00:00:19,971
(Raj:)Good?

9
00:00:20,642 --> 00:00:22,352
(Leonard:)Elizabeth? What's going on?

10
00:00:22,561 --> 00:00:25,651
(Elizabeth:)What's going on is you and Howard
are my moving men.

11
00:00:25,814 --> 00:00:27,234
(Elizabeth:)And Raj is my new landlord.

12
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:29,989
(Elizabeth:)And I don't have enough money
to pay any of you.

13
00:00:32,779 --> 00:00:35,739
(Leonard:)Is she suggesting
what I think she's suggesting?

14
00:00:35,907 --> 00:00:39,157
Yup. Welcome to
the Penthouse Forum.

15
00:00:39,619 --> 00:00:42,119
(Raj:)Okay, show of hands.
Who's up for this?

16
00:00:42,831 --> 00:00:44,831
(Leonard:)We'll all be naked
in front of each other.

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,250
(Howard:)I'm out.

18
00:00:47,794 --> 00:00:49,794
(Elizabeth:)Everybody ready?

19
00:00:50,463 --> 00:00:53,213
(Raj:)Follow my lead. Almost.

20
00:00:53,592 --> 00:00:56,882
(Raj:)We're going to go out into the hallway
and make a dramatic entrance.

21
00:00:57,095 --> 00:00:59,595
(Elizabeth:)Oh, good. It's so much better
when everyone commits.

